@base = http://localhost:5080
@serviceKey = development-only-service-key

### Регистрация (измените логин перед повтором)
# @name registration
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"eldar-demo","password":"Example-password-123!"}

### Токен берётся из ответа регистрации REST Client
@token = {{registration.response.body.token}}

### Каталог
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Создание черновика
# @name draft
POST {{base}}/api/configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Мой ПК","budgetRub":120000,"items":[{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","category":"CPU","quantity":1},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","category":"MOTHERBOARD","quantity":1},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003","category":"RAM","quantity":2},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004","category":"GPU","quantity":1},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","category":"PSU","quantity":1},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006","category":"CASE","quantity":1},{"productId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007","category":"STORAGE","quantity":1}]}

### Полная проверка
POST {{base}}/api/configurations/{{draft.response.body.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Сохранение
POST {{base}}/api/configurations/{{draft.response.body.id}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Публичная гистограмма
GET {{base}}/api/statistics/price-buckets

### Мои конфигурации
GET {{base}}/api/configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Создать магазинную корзину
POST {{base}}/api/configurations/{{draft.response.body.id}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
